          "message": {
            "text": "Symbols automatically selects workspace-local `language-servers.yaml` ahead of shared configuration. An untrusted repository can choose a language-server command and arguments that a routine file-backed request lazily starts with the user's local authority, without a repository-enforced trust decision."
          },
