          "message": {
            "text": "Symbols accepts the complete `textDocument/publishDiagnostics` array, retains it per URI without count or byte limits, maps and sorts every entry, and returns the complete formatted result as one MCP text item. Hostile workspace source can make an ordinary language server amplify a modest file into a costly local response."
